			"Message": "build(Land): Add ProductFlavor codes to build flavours and bump Tauri deps\n\nAnnotate each build flavour overlay with its ProductFlavor 10-char routing code:\n- Full (IFTNMMMMMM): IPC NodeDeferred, Mist WS, Mountain tasks/auth, rest Mountain\n- NodeFirst (INTNNNNNNN): all tiers routed through Cocoon Node.js\n- RustOnly (IWTAMMMMMM): all tiers Mountain-native, no Node fallback\n\nDocument the ProductFlavor 5×2-char encoding scheme in .env.Land.Sample:\n  IPC+WS, Tasks+Auth, Terminal+SCM+Debug, Search+Language+Output, Storage..Encryption\n\nAdd .lycheeignore to suppress known-false-positive link checker failures for shields.io badges, grace-hold domains (editor.land), NLnet URLs, and npmjs.com rate limits.\n\nBump three Tauri plugin crate versions to match their published releases:\n- tauri-plugin-barcode-scanner 2.4.4 → 2.4.5\n- tauri-plugin-global-shortcut 2.3.1 → 2.3.2\n- tauri-plugin-positioner 2.3.1 → 2.3.2",
